= Operations

\page[break=continuous, columns=(count=2, gap=0.8cm)]

== Hubs

The Rotterdam hub processed 1.4 million parcels in its first full quarter.
Throughput per labour hour is 18\% above the network average, largely due to
the automated sorter commissioned in July.

Lyon and Milan remain at 97\% and 101\% of rated capacity respectively; Milan
has operated above capacity for six consecutive weeks.

== Fleet

Average fleet age is 4.1 years. Twenty-two electric vans entered service in
September; their cost per kilometre is 31\% lower than diesel equivalents on
urban routes.\footnote{Includes charging infrastructure depreciation; excludes
the one-off grant of \$0.4M.}

\page[break=continuous, columns=1]

= Capital Expenditure {#sec:capex}

The Board is asked to approve *\$6.5M* for Phase 2 of the Rotterdam expansion
(see @fig:rev for regional growth). Payback is estimated at 3.1 years at
current volume growth.
